<mxfile host="Electron">
  <diagram id="EmMags_3KQQOcc9W5gFo" name="Page-1">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1511" dy="963" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;---\nconfig:\n  theme: neutral\n  themeVariables:\n    fontFamily: Arial\n    fontSize: 15px\n    lineColor: \&quot;#000000\&quot;\n    edgeLabelBackground: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;\n  flowchart:\n    curve: basis\n    nodeSpacing: 45\n    rankSpacing: 135\n    htmlLabels: true\n---\n\n%% Figure: AI Readiness Reporting Use Case Diagram\n%% Beaker Breakers Studio\n%% Scope: six dimension scoring, readiness classification and report access\n%% Source: Chapter 3 requirements FR-08.1 to FR-08.6, FR-09.1, SR-08\n%%         SRS Section 20, UC-05 Generate AI Readiness Report,\n%%         UC-13 View Own Readiness Status\n\n%% Shape note: Mermaid has no ellipse shape. Use cases are drawn here with the\n%% stadium shape ([text]). The Graphviz version of this figure uses true UML\n%% ellipses and is the one to place in the report.\n\nflowchart LR\n\n    %% ================= Actors =================\n    Teacher[\&quot;Teacher\&quot;]\n    Student[\&quot;Student\&quot;]\n    Gemini[\&quot;Gemini API&lt;br/&gt;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;external&amp;gt;&amp;gt;\&quot;]\n\n    %% ================= System boundary =================\n    subgraph SYS[\&quot;Beaker Breakers Studio (AI Readiness Reporting Scope)\&quot;]\n        UC05([\&quot;UC-05&lt;br/&gt;Generate AI Readiness Report\&quot;])\n        SCOPE([\&quot;Restrict Access to an Assigned Class\&quot;])\n        ELIG([\&quot;Check the Experiment Count&lt;br/&gt;of the Subject\&quot;])\n        DECL([\&quot;Decline the Report and&lt;br/&gt;State the Reason\&quot;])\n        DIM([\&quot;Compute the Six&lt;br/&gt;Performance Dimensions\&quot;])\n        CLASSIFY([\&quot;Classify as Not Ready, Approaching&lt;br/&gt;Readiness or Ready for Real Lab\&quot;])\n        STORE([\&quot;Record the Report with Teacher, Student,&lt;br/&gt;Values, Classification and Time\&quot;])\n\n        UC13([\&quot;UC-13&lt;br/&gt;View Own Readiness Status\&quot;])\n        OWN([\&quot;Present the Values and Classification&lt;br/&gt;of the Requesting Student Only\&quot;])\n    end\n\n    %% ================= Actor associations =================\n    Teacher --- UC05\n    Student --- UC13\n    DIM --- Gemini\n    CLASSIFY --- Gemini\n\n    %% ================= Include relationships =================\n    UC05 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-09.1\&quot;| SCOPE\n    UC05 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-08.4\&quot;| ELIG\n    UC05 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-08.1\&quot;| DIM\n    UC05 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-08.3\&quot;| CLASSIFY\n    UC05 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-08.5\&quot;| STORE\n    UC13 -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;include&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-08.6\&quot;| OWN\n\n    %% ================= Extend relationship =================\n    DECL -.-&gt;|\&quot;&amp;lt;&amp;lt;extend&amp;gt;&amp;gt; FR-08.4&lt;br/&gt;[fewer than 3 experiments completed]\&quot;| UC05\n\n    %% ================= Constraint notes =================\n    %% FR-08.1: the six dimensions are procedural accuracy, safety compliance,\n    %%          reagent management, time efficiency, conceptual understanding\n    %%          and error recovery.\n    %% FR-08.2: a report is presented within 5 seconds of the teacher request.\n    %% FR-08.6 and SR-08: a student is never shown the dimension values,\n    %%          classification or assessment record of another student.\n\n    %% ================= Styling (outline only, no fill colour) =================\n    classDef actor fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n    classDef ext fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,stroke-dasharray:5 4,color:#000000\n    classDef uc fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n\n    class Teacher,Student actor\n    class Gemini ext\n    class UC05,SCOPE,ELIG,DECL,DIM,CLASSIFY,STORE,UC13,OWN uc\n\n    style SYS fill:#ffffff,stroke:#000000,stroke-width:1.5px,color:#000000\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="26">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
